msgid ""
"The jD-PPM Encoder (v2.1) uses the ArduPPM firmware, replacing the "
"previously used Paparazzi PPM Encoder firmware. The new ArduPPM firmware has"
" been designed from scratch to enhance performance and robustness, and to "
"better accommodate our product needs now and in the future."
msgstr ""
"jD-PPM 编码器（v2.1）使用 ArduPPM 固件，取代了之前使用的 Paparazzi PPM 编码器固件。新的 ArduPPM "
"固件从头设计，旨在提升性能和可靠性，更好地满足当前和未来的产品需求。"

