"<plane:apms-failsafe-function>` 的 wiki 中所述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder.rst:57
#: 4d5e02e330f24a0981ca29bb779abaa6 52291e704fca4db6a7fe307965f988b4
#: 77ed43c66cf94e1994e249410fe2b4cf 9c26e958f8d846db953d315cc2dbafb0
#: f0a954d958fb49a892cb2ec5577da079
msgid ""
"Also note that this has nothing to do with losing the radio connection "
"between the transmitter and the receiver. The receiver's behaviour when it "
"gets out of range depends on the transmitter/receiver hardware and setup. So"
" make sure to go through all the scenarios before flying"
msgstr "还需注意，这与遥控器和接收机之间失去无线连接无关。接收机超出范围时的行为取决于遥控器/接收机的硬件和设置，因此请务必在飞行前测试所有场景"

