#: db8ae526219f4350b194889407089bdc
msgid ""
"The `PPM Encoder Manual "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/PPM-"
"Encoder-V3-Manual.pdf>`__ shows how to solder and wire the PPM Encoder and "
"explains the different failsafe modes."
