"`PPM 编码器手册 <https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/pdf_guides/PPM-"
"Encoder-V3-Manual.pdf>`__ 介绍了如何焊接和连接 PPM 编码器，并说明了不同的失控保护模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder.rst:74
#: 256baa8727e649d7887d1f88944a896d 4860aa1611d945fb8887813f28d9a8fe
#: 531b33e8eb9843aab51316173fe639f0 59cbf3d0e37e412cb155b79b7fff5652
#: 9e383b9122424464a970467e60a18722
msgid "Re-Programming the Atmega328p PPM encoder"
msgstr "重新编程 Atmega328p PPM 编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder.rst:78
#: 393f1c51e17a4b0c81cb5e68d339641a 3d948876552b43a4976c3c95e56bddc6
#: 6525f8b72fc64c5d9b023a3ed4848b85 828b58cd48eb4389aabcf2e044ddd637
#: b196278d8cad414783f0992635ba102d
msgid ""
"The PPM Encoder comes with the PPM encoder firmware pre-programmed, and most"
" users will never need or want to modify it."
msgstr "PPM 编码器出厂时已预装了 PPM 编码器固件，大多数用户永远不需要修改它。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder.rst:82
#: a48e06e1e671468ea196a4690d97c481 b2a763e1f89240449845bb0c4c2b62e7
#: bdb920a8debb44ac878557ed74f08161 ceb63ac57b7e4eebbd9b550a05bc9823
#: dea45f9270a848cf9c292173763a6983
msgid ""
"However, some users may want to get into the code to change the way the PPM "
"Encoder interprets RC signals or may want to update to the latest version. "
"Some rare users did report receiver compatility problems with the old "
"version (before ArduPPM). For most cases, ArduPPM did solve them."
msgstr ""
"但某些用户可能希望修改代码以改变 PPM 编码器解析 RC 信号的方式，或更新到最新版本。少数用户报告与旧版本（ArduPPM "
"之前）存在接收机兼容性问题，在大多数情况下，ArduPPM 已解决了这些问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder.rst:88
#: 0bcd6f6e88204af9bb158829ce6e1b0c 2873881d758443499f08d8249f1ac4f0
#: 69ccf2778fa94ec0988426bed4e75feb 8429723e83bc48bb9e256af01b33d038
#: a95b386a28d1443fa2178bdde3290256
msgid ""
"ArduPPM is the official name for the newer generation firmwares. It has been"
" designed from scratch with reliability as a top priority. The official "
"release of the encoder firmware is in the Downloads section as "
"ArduPPM_Vx.x.xx_ATMega328p.hex. The official source code is in the Git "
"repository: "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/ArduPPM. The "
"standalone PPM Encoder needs the ATMega328p version."
msgstr ""
"ArduPPM 是新一代固件的官方名称，从头设计，以可靠性为首要目标。编码器固件的官方版本以 "
"ArduPPM_Vx.x.xx_ATMega328p.hex 发布在下载区。官方源代码在 Git "
"仓库中：https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/ArduPPM。独立 PPM "
"编码器需要 ATMega328p 版本。"

